Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Khasnad cusub: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault sir-geli: message fure: key.
>> decrypted := vault sir-fur: encrypted fure: key.

Soo-saar 
qor: ['Message:'], sadar-cusub
qor: message, sadar-cusub
qor: ['Decrypted:'], sadar-cusub
qor: decrypted, sadar-cusub.
